The '''Treasure Festival''' is an event that appears only for [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapter Levels]]. It doubles the drop chance of the stage [[Treasure]]s.

==Event==
This event only appears in the Main Chapters. When it is active, you have a doubled chance to get treasure in active stages during this event. This event usually lasts an hour, occurring at least once a day. The schedule for when the next festival will occur is on the [https://ponos.s3.amazonaws.com/information/appli/battlecats/calendar/en/index.html PONOS Event Calendar].

Sometimes, during a big celebration event like [[Meow Meow Day]] or an [[Anniversary]], a Treasure Festival will be on to celebrate the event, lasting one day on Meow Meow Day and a few weeks for most other events. During this time, the treasure chances will be doubled in either [[Empire of Cats]] or [[Into the Future]], alternating between the two. Additionally, every third day, [[Cats of the Cosmos]] will also have improved treasure chances.

If a Treasure Festival is on, in the bottom left corner of the Stage Select screen there will be a message that says how long is left on it. This message will also override the one for [[Zombie Outbreaks]].

