==Treasure Chance==
The Treasure Chance is a similar event that appears randomly in any one [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapter]] that does not have all 48 Superior treasures, and also has at least one stage cleared. Unlike regular Treasure Festivals, it does not appear on the schedule, lasts only 30 minutes, and only affects one stage in one Chapter. Tapping the Treasure Chance icon will bring you to the stage with the increased treasure chance.

